uman readable なオプションでも設定できるようになってた \u0026gt; tmux 3.2","ts":"1627714080.014000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b5RM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd61bdf9-0a39-43d5-aacc-bddc0c5b8ac2","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"tmux 3.2 で `copy-command` という便利オプションが誕生してた","ts":"1627713967.013100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nbg48"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a80faea1-5616-4cac-a038-a5e9966a04af","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"iTerm2勢ですけど文字数制限で死ぬことがまれにあったので使うのを諦めた記憶","ts":"1627713939.012500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PiTNy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e98996c-b9f6-4f8f-9c64-54a41c332ccf","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://zenn.dev/link/comments/e332bdc47400cf\u003e\ntmux wiki の内容をまとめた","ts":"1627713910.011600","attachments":[{"fallback":"Zenn: Zenn | エンジニアのための情報共有コミュニティ","id":1,"title":"Zenn | エンジニアのための情報共有コミュニティ","title_link":"https://zenn.dev/link/comments/e332bdc47400cf","image_url":"https://zenn.dev/images/og-large.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Zenn","service_icon":"https://zenn.dev/images/icon.png","from_url":"https://zenn.dev/link/comments/e332bdc47400cf","original_url":"https://zenn.dev/link/comments/e332bdc47400cf"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U01D9BALEKU","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9PgoC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d0ae9ab-d32f-4e1e-9c56-95a56bac60fc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"エスケープ周りは色々ありすぎて分からない…","ts":"1627711044.010900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qok"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f10f9dc-1dad-43b0-a067-c5575244ab55","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そういえばwindowsからssh繋ぐとマウスが全く使えなくなるんですよね\nクリックもスクロールもだめ\nターミナルエミュレータによらないのでssh.exeがエスケープシーケンスを吸ってると思う","ts":"1627711028.010300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vea/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4809da6f-c851-42cf-86c4-c6267e86ca4b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"winの設定とも共存させたいし、知らんこと多くてめんどいなあ","ts":"1627710949.008200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zbw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54502c76-3581-48e4-9609-69c4b8e5448a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003c#CNX3F8RFC|tech-cli\u003e で指摘されてたとおり、文字数制限があるっぽいのでそれは注意\nSSH 先からコピーできるはずってのとターミナルエミュレータ側が OS 間の差異を吸収してくれるはずなので、OS 毎に設定を変えなくていいってのと天秤にかける感じですね多分","ts":"1627710502.007400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fXSkG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9f9b5af-fa1b-4284-ac7b-2feb38219101","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ﾀｰﾐﾅﾙ ﾅﾆﾓﾜｶﾗﾅｲ","ts":"1627708212.005100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2yZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95fcb066-f865-41f2-8b3e-becd5013a21e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ﾏｼﾞｶﾖ","ts":"1627707951.004800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VBBpi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5640b9c-d67d-4526-aa7a-07b07acbe63a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、VTE 系ターミナルエミュレータは使えないらしい \u0026gt; OSC 52\niTerm2 は設定で有効化できる (デフォ無効)","ts":"1627702769.004500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5/2a3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4393a0e7-fe3a-477d-a95e-98ad9cb5e577","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/tmux/tmux/wiki/Clipboard\u003e\nどうやら、`bind-key -T copy-mode-vi Enter send -X copy-pipe-and-cancel 'xsel -i'` あたりの記述は少なくとも alacritty 上で tmux を動かしているなら書かなくていいっぽい\nデフォで \u003c#CNX3F8RFC|tech-cli\u003e に書いた OSC 52 を使ったクリップボード連携が有効になってるらしい\nで、なんなら設定がコンフリクトするので copy-pipe による設定をしたければ `set-clipboard off` すること、らしい","ts":"1627702628.003200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OAR"}]}]
